WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.890
SPEAKER: Hard work, discipline,
and the American spirit.

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:09.300
The US Olympic Shooting Team
builds on these good things

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.820
in order to produce champions.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.880
That's why Hillsdale
College is proud to partner

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.760
with USA Shooting.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.480
Together, we can forge a
new generation of champions

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:26.520
and build a legacy of American
shooting sports for the future.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.500
[MUSIC PLAYING]

